# The build context is an allowlist: only what the image needs, so .git, data/, docs/, caches and stray files
# at the top never enter it. Inside the allowed folders everything enters unless excluded below: caches, and
# anything that looks like a secret (a file under src/.../static would even be served). .env.example is kept
# because a settings test reads it in the test stage.
*
!src
!tests
!scripts
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.python-version
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
!.env.example
**/id_rsa*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
